{"2886580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Toyful Wonderworld", "steam_appid": 2886580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, one and all, to the most joyful, Toyful Wonderworld, where imagination shines as bright as the stars! Or at least, that's how it used to be. Due to something utterly unknown, all the staff of this magical place have disappeared, and the complex has locked itself down. Meanwhile, the formerly pleasant Toyfriends within its walls have become violent and weird! Armed with your gun, you must explore Toyful Wonderworld and find out who or what is responsible for these strange events that triggered its lockdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Damien Dalbrekker, an agent of the Odd Occurrences Prevention Syndicate, sent in to find out why Toyful Wonderworld was closed off from the outside world and to neutralize any threats encountered along the way. While you're initially armed with only a pistol, many more weapons can be found wielded by the Toyfriends that can be taken from them upon defeat. Your objective is to explore the numerous bizarre locations within the complex by unlocking security doors and shooting enemies, in order to access the Grand Factory at the center of Toyful Wonderworld. A helpful companion named Mister Phunkyfone will provide you with tips along the way, and you can also activate various computer systems around the facility that will yield information about the employees that worked here. Be careful though, as there may be some true horrors hidden deep within this cursed place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in GameMaker Studio, this is my first game to be published on here and I'm very proud by what I've been able to create. Toyful Wonderworld is heavily inspired by an obscure Windows game called Bad Toys 3D, with some elements from other retro shooters of the 1990s!     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 35 levels to explore, taking place in the various attractions across Toyful Wonderworld.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ten different weapons can be found throughout the game, ranging from your basic Pistol to the explosive Super Launcher!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter over 30 unique enemies and bosses, providing new challenges around every corner!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customizable control and sound options to suit your needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three difficulty settings that will make enemies more aggressive and increase the rewards you can find!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple collectible cards and records can be found, allowing you to view the various enemies up close and listen to the music of the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, one and all, to the most joyful, Toyful Wonderworld, where imagination shines as bright as the stars! Or at least, that's how it used to be. Due to something utterly unknown, all the staff of this magical place have disappeared, and the complex has locked itself down. Meanwhile, the formerly pleasant Toyfriends within its walls have become violent and weird! Armed with your gun, you must explore Toyful Wonderworld and find out who or what is responsible for these strange events that triggered its lockdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Damien Dalbrekker, an agent of the Odd Occurrences Prevention Syndicate, sent in to find out why Toyful Wonderworld was closed off from the outside world and to neutralize any threats encountered along the way. While you're initially armed with only a pistol, many more weapons can be found wielded by the Toyfriends that can be taken from them upon defeat. Your objective is to explore the numerous bizarre locations within the complex by unlocking security doors and shooting enemies, in order to access the Grand Factory at the center of Toyful Wonderworld. A helpful companion named Mister Phunkyfone will provide you with tips along the way, and you can also activate various computer systems around the facility that will yield information about the employees that worked here. Be careful though, as there may be some true horrors hidden deep within this cursed place...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in GameMaker Studio, this is my first game to be published on here and I'm very proud by what I've been able to create. Toyful Wonderworld is heavily inspired by an obscure Windows game called Bad Toys 3D, with some elements from other retro shooters of the 1990s!     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 35 levels to explore, taking place in the various attractions across Toyful Wonderworld.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ten different weapons can be found throughout the game, ranging from your basic Pistol to the explosive Super Launcher!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter over 30 unique enemies and bosses, providing new challenges around every corner!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customizable control and sound options to suit your needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three difficulty settings that will make enemies more aggressive and increase the rewards you can find!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple collectible cards and records can be found, allowing you to view the various enemies up close and listen to the music of the game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A retro first-person game inspired by shooters of the 90s. Collect weapons and blast your way through the mysterious Toyful Wonderworld, where a cast of colorful enemies will stand in your way. Discover the secrets of this weird place and find out what has caused the Toyfriends to go crazy!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886580/cae3abaac967b2fb852f5775763866f4d5c15b09/header.jpg?t=1779427730", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886580/f6d2aff135d3518aecbaa4f576305ff0e98085e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779427730", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886580/f6d2aff135d3518aecbaa4f576305ff0e98085e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779427730", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 and up, DirectX 11 required, 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 900 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "r